Template: bitscan/manager_url
Type: string
Description: Bitscan manager URL:
 HTTPS address of the Bitscan manager, for example
 https://mgr.example:8443. Plain HTTP is refused.

Template: bitscan/enrol_token
Type: password
Description: Bitscan enrolment token:
 Enrolment token (bse_...) created by an administrator in the Bitscan
 manager. It is written to /var/lib/bitscan-agent/enroll.token and then
 cleared from the debconf database.

Template: bitscan/ca_file
Type: string
Description: CA bundle for the manager certificate (optional):
 Path to the CA bundle that signed the manager's certificate, for a
 private manager. Leave it empty to use the system CA store.

Template: bitscan/manager_spki_sha256
Type: string
Description: Pin of the manager public key (optional):
 SHA-256 of the DER SubjectPublicKeyInfo of the manager's certificate, as
 64 hexadecimal characters. The pin is checked in addition to the
 certificate chain. Leave it empty for no pin.
